@startuml
title SplitSmart Layered Modular Monolith and Maven Dependencies
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "splitsmart-desktop" {
  [Swing screens / dialogs] as Swing
  [Controllers / presenters] as Controllers
  [Composition root] as Bootstrap
}
package "splitsmart-application" {
  [Use cases] as UseCases
  [Repository and gateway ports] as Ports
}
package "splitsmart-domain" {
  [Entities and value objects] as Domain
  [Allocation / approval / balance policies] as Policies
}
package "splitsmart-infrastructure" {
  [JDBC repositories / migrations] as JDBC
  [Notification / receipt adapters] as Adapters
}
database "SQLite" as DB
Swing --> Controllers
Controllers --> UseCases : commands / results
UseCases --> Domain
UseCases --> Ports : calls abstractions
Policies --> Domain
JDBC ..|> Ports
Adapters ..|> Ports
Bootstrap --> UseCases : wires
Bootstrap --> JDBC : wires
Bootstrap --> Adapters : wires
JDBC --> DB
note right of Domain
  No dependency on Swing,
  JDBC or vendor APIs.
end note
note bottom
  One application deployment. Modules are code boundaries,
  not independently deployed services.
end note
@enduml
